=\"true\" class=\"relative select-none overflow-hidden aspect-[3/4] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg ring-1 ring-neutral-900/10\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-700 bg-neutral-100 opacity-100\"></div><canvas role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tube — Graphite — studio photograph\" class=\"block h-full w-full\"></canvas><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-neutral-400\">02<!-- --> · Studio portrait</figcaption></figure><figure><div data-protected=\"true\" class=\"relative select-none overflow-hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg ring-1 ring-neutral-900/10 aspect-[3/4] sm:aspect-[4/3]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-700 bg-neutral-100 opacity-100\"></div><canvas role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tube — Graphite — Four cylinders, one rhythm — the kitchen wall in full light.\" class=\"block h-full w-full\"></canvas><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-neutral-400\"><span>Four cylinders, one rhythm — the kitchen wall in full light.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-neutral-200\"></span></figcaption></figure><figure><div data-protected=\"true\" class=\"relative select-none overflow-hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg ring-1 ring-neutral-900/10 aspect-[3/4] sm:aspect-[4/3]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-700 bg-neutral-100 opacity-100\"></div><canvas role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tube — Graphite — The run at dusk — quiet by day, composed after dark.\" class=\"block h-full w-full\"></canvas><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10\"></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-neutral-400\"><span>The run at dusk — quiet by day, composed after dark.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-neutral-200\"></span></figcaption></figure></div><aside class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:sticky lg:top-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-neutral-600 text-neutral-700\">The same cylinder, dressed in matte graphite. On dark walls the graphite Tube almost disappears — leaving only the light — while on pale walls it sharpens into a deliberate graphic tick, a punctuation mark on the plaster.</p><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-neutral-600 \">Interior architects reach for the graphite edition when a wall carries artwork or joinery: the fixture frames without competing, and the diffuser keeps the disc of light soft enough to sit beside almost anything.</p></div><dl class=\"border-t border-neutral-200\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-200 py-3.5\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Diameter</dt><dd class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-neutral-800\">⌀ 90 mm</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-200 py-3.5\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Source</dt><dd class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-neutral-800\">2700 K · CRI 90</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-200 py-3.5\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Power</dt><dd class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-neutral-800\">6 W — dimmable</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-200 py-3.5\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Mounting</dt><dd class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-neutral-800\">Surface, up or down</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-200 py-3.5\"><dt class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Finish</dt><dd class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-neutral-800\">Graphite black — matte powder-coat</dd></div></dl><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-4\"><a href=\"mailto:hello@batolite.com?subject=Enquiry%20%E2%80%94%20Tube%20%E2%80%94%20Graphite\" class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-7 py-3.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] transition-colors border-neutral-300 text-neutral-900 hover:border-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-900 hover:text-white \">Enquire about <!-- -->Tube</a><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Quotations, finishes and lead times — the studio replies within two working days.</p></div></div></aside></section><nav aria-label=\"More products\" class=\"border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] grid-cols-1 divide-y divide-neutral-200 px-5 md:grid-cols-2 md:divide-x md:divide-y-0 md:px-10\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col gap-1.5 py-10 pr-6 transition-colors md:py-14\" href=\"/products/tube-chalk\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">← Previous — <!-- -->01</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-neutral-900 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-1 md:text-3xl\">Tube — Chalk</span></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-start gap-1.5 py-10 pl-6 text-right transition-colors md:items-end md:py-14\" href=\"/products/flute-concrete\"><span class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-400\">Next — <!-- -->03<!-- --> →</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-neutral-900 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:text-3xl\">Flute — Concrete</span></a></div></nav><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1400px] justify-center px-5 pb-16 md:pb-20\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-neutral-900 \" href=\"/products\"><span class=\"border